problem=section('problem','<div class="problem-grid"><h2>A full week should not leave an empty pipeline.</h2><div><p class="lead">You close a deal. Delivery takes over. Prospecting slips. A month later, you are back asking your network who needs what you sell.</p><p>That is too much of the pipeline resting on you. Give the outbound to a team that owns the work all the way to the calendar.</p></div></div>')
