system=section('system',intro('The handoff is where outbound breaks.<br>We own it.','A reply is not a meeting. A meeting with the wrong person is not a qualified opportunity. We run the work between the first email and the call you actually want to take.','The Inbox-to-Meeting System')+'<div class="system-pipeline"><div class="pipeline-connector" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>'+''.join(f'<article class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-symbol">{icon("calendar" if symbol=="calendar" else "people" if symbol=="list" else "check" if symbol=="close" else "mail")}</div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{sub}</p></article>' for title,sub,symbol in systemsteps)+'</div><div class="system-proof"><span class="response-clock"><b>05:00</b><span>Reply handling</span></span><p>Five-minute replies, human callbacks and multi-touch follow-up. See where each mechanic changed the outcome.</p><a class="text-link" href="/case-studies">Read the campaigns '+icon()+'</a></div>','system-section')
